  "contentHtml": "<p><br></p><p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3Df7qd%26dataid%3D36%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20190309093257&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile293.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F992E98395D18518809B445')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 수상소감 김영학.m4a</a></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">안녕하십니까?</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">아이들이 행복한 교육도시 오산시 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">성호고등학교 교사 김영학입니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">고전은 한 줄 한 줄 천천히 읽게 하는 힘이 있다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">고전은 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">'</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">읽는 책</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">'</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이 아닌 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">'</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">생각하는 책</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">'</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이라는 것이다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">  </span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">'</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">너 아리스토텔레스의 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">'</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">시학</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">' </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">읽어봤어</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">?'</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">가 아니라</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">'</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">너 아리스토텔레스의 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">'</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">시학</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">' </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">생각해봤어</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">?' </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">하고 물어야 정확한 질문이라고 느껴진다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">  </span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">응 고작 두 시간 생각해봤어</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">다시 읽고 더 생각해보고 싶어</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></span></p><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">세인트존스의 고전 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">100</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">권 공부법</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">’ 을 읽으면서</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학생들과 이런 독서활동을 하고 싶었습니다.</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">유미과학문화재단에서 과학교사</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"> 앞으로 온&nbsp;우연한 선물, 사피엔스</span></p><p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><!--StartFragment--></span><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">선생님들에게 무료로 과학책을 보내주는 재단도 있네</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">!</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">무슨 책이지</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">? </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">과학책인가</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">?’</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">책을 읽으면서 신세계를 경험하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">인류의 역사</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">문화</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">사회</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">과학</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">철학을 망라하는 대서사시를 접하면서 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">지적 희열과 감동을 느꼈습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">!</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴바탕;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">  </span></span></p><p><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">그래서 꿈을 꾸었습니다.</span><br></span></span></p><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">사피엔스</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">’</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">로 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">'</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">나</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이 책 읽어 봤어</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">'</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">가 아니라 </span></p><p><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">'</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">나</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이 책 읽고 생각해보고 이야기 나눠봤어</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">'</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">를 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">제</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">자들과 함께 하고 싶었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><p><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">사피엔스 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">49</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">쪽</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">:</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-style: italic; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 10pt; font-style: italic; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">우리는 허구 덕분에 단순한 상상을 넘어서 집단적으로 상상할 수 있게&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-style: italic; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">되었다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-style: italic; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-style: italic; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 10pt; font-style: italic; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-style: italic; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">그런 신화들 덕분에 사피엔스는 많은 숫자가 모여 유연하게</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; font-style: italic; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-style: italic; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">협력하는 유례없는 능력을 가질 수 있었다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-style: italic; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">* 학생들의 </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">토의주제는</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">우리는 허구를 정말 믿는가</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">? </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">왜 믿는가</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">? 와 같은 것이었습니다.</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><p><br></p><p><br></p></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">독서토론 시간에 보여주는 학생들의 모습은 교사를 깜짝깜짝 놀라게 합니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">늘 부족하다고 생각했던 우리 학교 학생들이 이런 질문</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이런 생각</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이런 토론을 하다니</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">!’</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">제가 갖고 있었던 학생에 대한 낙인효과</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">교육적 편견을&nbsp;반성했습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">.</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">저는 이제</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">새로운 꿈을 꿉니다.</span><br></p></span><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">대한민국의 학생들이 획일적으로 국정교과서를 읽고</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">받아 적고</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span></span><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">지선다형에 답하는</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"> 과거의 교육이 아니라</span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">사피엔스</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">호모데우스</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">코스모스 등의 명저를</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"> </span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">함께 읽으며 질문하고</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, 토론하며</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">생각에 잠길 수 있는 아이들의 모습을 일상적으로 볼 수 있는 미래 교실</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">!</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp; </span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이런 교육을 희망합니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">! </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">그리고</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"> 실천하겠습니다</span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">! </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">교사의 교육적 상상을 실현하는데 튼실한 씨앗을 제공해주신 </span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">유미과학문화재단에 다시 한 번 감사의 말씀을 드립니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">!</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">번역이란 외국어를 옮기는 작업이 아니라, 한국어를 바로 세우는 작업이라고 합니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">좋은 책을 우리 글로 만날 수 있게 해주신 사피엔스의 번역가 조현욱 선생님께도 감사를 드립니다.</span></p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><p><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">고맙습니다!</span></p></span><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">- 2019.3.6. &nbsp; 제5회 유미과학문화재단 과학독서지도상 시상식에서-</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9985DE4B5D66FEBA0F\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"687\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"687\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"watermark_687x0_cats6.jpg\"  id=\"A_9985DE4B5D66FEBA0F5EB6\"/></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><br></span></p><p>------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p><br></p><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">과학독서사례 소개 파일 :</span></strong><br></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3Df7qd%26dataid%3D36%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20190309093257&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile290.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F99680C4A5C8B66C6322C3E')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 사피엔스를 읽고 느끼고 토론하기(성호고 김영학).hwp</a></p><p><br></p><p><u><br></